// Sheet: "persistent AoE control zone; damage-on-enter/start-of-turn rider".
// This is the first Conjuration zone whose PRIMARY described effect is pure
// damage-over-time rather than a control debuff (contrast entangle/fog_cloud/
// grease, all pure control, no damage) -- so unlike those sibling zones, this
// does NOT collapse to a one-shot GroundAoe burst (that would drop the
// "shreds anything that enters or remains" persistence, which is this
// spell's whole identity). `StaticAura` (see transmutation/plant_growth.ron)
// already supports a `Vec<AuraBuffConstructor>`, and `BuffKind::Bleeding` is
// a real per-tick HP-drain buff (`common/src/comp/buff.rs`, tick_dur 0.5s) --
// this is the first time a StaticAura zone in this content pass delivers a
// damage buff instead of a pure control one, but it's the same primitive
// pairing, not a new mechanic. Slashing flavor matches Bleeding's own
// physical-wound framing directly (no flavor mismatch, unlike the
// Energy-hardcoded GroundAoe spells). `StaticAura` always places the zone at
// the caster's own position (no aimed placement exists,
// common/src/states/static_aura.rs) -- the sheet's 18 m cast range isn't
// mechanically expressed, the same simplification entangle/fog_cloud/grease
// already ship with. The sheet's true footprint (a 1.5 m cube) is
// approximated as a small sphere, same as the sheet's own note suggests.
StaticAura(
    buildup_duration: 0.6,
    cast_duration: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.4,
    energy_cost: 55.0,
    targets: OutOfGroup,
    auras: [
        (kind: Bleeding, strength: 5.0, duration: Some(2), category: Some(Magical)),
    ],
    aura_duration: Some(20.0),
    range: 3.0,
    sprite_info: None,
    meta: (school: Some(Conjuration), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
